    the number of ``Q`` items), and a 32-byte lowercase hex ``mac``.
    Both the inner body and the outer document must be canonical compact
    JSON, so re-encoding the parsed record must equal the input byte for
    byte; formatted JSON, whitespace and non-canonical number spellings
    are rejected. The MAC is not verified here — use
    :meth:`Verifier.resume_bits` with the shared key for that.
    """
